@page
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Оформление заказа"; ViewData["BodyClass"] = "checkout-page"; }
<div class="container page-space"><h1>Оформление заказа</h1><div id="checkout-auth-notice" class="notice checkout-guest-notice" hidden><p>Можно заказать без регистрации. Войдите, если хотите сохранить заказ в общей истории профиля.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" id="checkout-optional-login">Войти — необязательно</button></div><form id="checkout-form" method="post" novalidate><fieldset id="checkout-loader" disabled aria-busy="true" class="checkout-loader"><div class="checkout-grid"><div><section class="form-panel"><div class="segmented receiving"><button type="button" data-method="pickup"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="/images/icons.svg?v=20261028-v20#bag" /></svg>С собой</button><button type="button" data-method="delivery"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="/images/icons.svg?v=20261028-v20#truck" /></svg>Доставка</button></div><div id="delivery-fields" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="city">Город</label><input id="city" name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" maxlength="80" placeholder="Например, Москва…" /><span class="form-error" data-error="city"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="street">Улица и дом</label><input id="street" name="street" autocomplete="street-address" maxlength="160" placeholder="Например, Ленина, 10…" /><span class="form-error" data-error="street"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="apartment">Квартира</label><input id="apartment" name="apartment" autocomplete="off" maxlength="30" placeholder="Например, 12…" /><span class="form-error" data-error="apartment"></span></div></div><div id="pickup-fields" class="field"><label for="cafe">Выберите кафе</label><select id="cafe" name="cafe"><option value="">Выберите кафе</option><option value="demo-house">Mellow House</option></select><span class="form-error" data-error="cafe"></span><p class="small muted" id="pickup-details">Адрес и график кафе уточняются. Самовывоз — бесплатно.</p></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="customer-name">Имя</label><input id="customer-name" name="name" autocomplete="given-name" maxlength="80" placeholder="Как к вам обращаться…" required /><span class="form-error" data-error="name"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="phone">Телефон для связи по заказу</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="18" data-phone placeholder="+7 (999) 123-45-67…" required /><span class="form-error" data-error="phone"></span></div></div><fieldset class="timing"><legend>Время получения</legend><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="timing" value="asap" checked />Как можно скорее</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="timing" value="scheduled" />Ко времени</label><div class="field" id="scheduled-field" hidden><label for="scheduledLocal">Дата и время (МСК)</label><input id="scheduledLocal" type="datetime-local" name="scheduledLocal" /><span class="form-error" data-error="scheduledLocal"></span><small>От 30 минут до 7 дней вперёд.</small></div><span class="form-error" data-error="timing" role="alert"></span></fieldset><div class="field"><label for="comment">Комментарий к заказу (необязательно)</label><textarea id="comment" name="comment" maxlength="500" rows="3" placeholder="Домофон, ориентиры, пожелания…"></textarea><span class="form-error" data-error="comment"></span></div></section><section class="form-panel"><h2>Способ оплаты</h2><div class="payment-choices" id="checkout-payment-choices"></div><span class="form-error" data-error="paymentMethod"></span></section></div><aside class="order-summary" id="checkout-summary"><h2>Ваш заказ</h2><div id="checkout-items"></div><div id="checkout-totals"></div><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" />Принимаю <a href="/Legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">условия оформления заказа</a>.</label><span class="form-error" data-error="consent"></span><p class="form-error" id="checkout-error" role="alert"></p><button class="btn wide" type="submit" id="place-order">Перейти к оплате</button><p id="draft-status" class="small muted" role="status"></p></aside></div></fieldset></form></div>
